      "created_at": "2015-10-24T18:03:23.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Only allowed Unity to deal damage. Finished with all five heroes in double digits.</p><p>Biggest risk was getting Lost in the Past. Most of the environment deck was in play, but neutered by Mass Levitation and Mega Computers. Multiple Grappling Hooks to take Lost in the Past out of the play when necessary.</p><p>Wraith used Infrared Eyepiece to bury Prison Breaks.</p><p>Argent Adept mostly healed himself, gave Unity out-of-turn plays, and allowed Visionary to give Unity out of turn draws.</p><div>\n<p>Legacy boosted damage and used Take Downs and Heroic Interceptions to slow/neuter the villain.</p>\n<p>Let the Crooked Cops and Enforcers stay in play and just blasted through the damage reduction and dealt with the card discard.</p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:45:42.813Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
